, an approval must be requested; but if the risk is low the credit is accepted.\\nAfter the approval request, the credit could be accepted or rejected; in both cases, an email is sent to the customer.\\nThe credit company collects the credit information from the customer, If the requested amount is lower or equal to 1M$ the company assess the risk of the credit.\\nAfter the assessment, if the risk is low the credit is accepted.\\nIf the requested amount is greater than 1M$ or the risk of the credit is high, an approval must be requested.\\nAfter the approval request, the credit could be accepted or rejected; in both cases, an email is sent to the customer.\\n"}
