Label>\\n      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>\\n      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id=\\"SequenceFlow_0v64x8b_di\\" bpmnElement=\\"SequenceFlow_0v64x8b\\">\\n        <di:waypoint x=\\"1354\\" y=\\"707\\" />\\n        <di:waypoint x=\\"1383\\" y=\\"707\\" />\\n        <di:waypoint x=\\"1383\\" y=\\"500\\" />\\n        <di:waypoint x=\\"1412\\" y=\\"500\\" />\\n        <bpmndi:BPMNLabel>\\n          <dc:Bounds x=\\"1341\\" y=\\"697\\" width=\\"90\\" height=\\"20\\" />\\n        </bpmndi:BPMNLabel>\\n      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>\\n      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id=\\"Flow_1dffksp_di\\" bpmnElement=\\"Flow_1dffksp\\">\\n        <di:waypoint x=\\"365\\" y=\\"484\\" />\\n        <di:waypoint x=\\"410\\" y=\\"484\\" />\\n      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>\\n      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id=\\"Flow_0oy4ts6_di\\" bpmnElement=\\"Flow_0oy4ts6\\">\\n        <di:waypoint x=\\"510\\" y=\\"484\\" />\\n        <di:waypoint x=\\"555\\" y=\\"484\\" />\\n      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>\\n      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id=\\"Flow_1yl85im_di\\" bpmnElement=\\"Flow_1yl85im\\">\\n        <di:waypoint x=\\"605\\" y=\\"484\\" />\\n        <di:waypoint x=\\"628\\" y=\\"484\\" />\\n      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>\\n      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id=\\"Flow_009yq8j_di\\" bpmnElement=\\"Flow_009yq8j\\">\\n        <di:waypoint x=\\"580\\" y=\\"509\\" />\\n        <di:waypoint x=\\"580\\" y=\\"707\\" />\\n        <di:waypoint x=\\"630\\" y=\\"707\\" />\\n      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>\\n      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id=\\"Flow_1rf74nn_di\\" bpmnElement=\\"Flow_1rf74nn\\">\\n        <di:waypoint x=\\"730\\" y=\\"707\\" />\\n        <di:waypoint x=\\"911\\" y=\\"707\\" />\\n      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>\\n    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>\\n  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>\\n</bpmn:definitions>\\n", "bpmn_model_description": "The model depicts the “Ship goods” process of a computer‑hardware shop and is split into two lanes – Secretary and Warehouse. The Secretary first **clarifies the shipment method** (Task “Clarify shipment method”). A parallel gateway then launches two independent streams: one for **logistics handling** and one for **packaging preparation**.  \\n\\nIn the logistics stream the flow reaches an exclusive gateway “Special handling?”. If the answer is “no”, the process skips directly to an inclusive gateway that decides whether insurance is required; if “yes”, the Secretary **gets three offers from logistic companies**, **selects a carrier and places the order**, and then joins the same inclusive gateway. The inclusive gateway branches to **“Insure parcel”** (only when insurance is needed) and always to **“Write package label”**; both paths converge on another exclusive gateway that reunites the logistics decisions.  \\n\\nSimultaneously, the packaging stream moves from the parallel gateway to the activity **“choose Packaging”**, then to **“Package goods”**. Both the completed logistics branch and the packaging branch flow into a parallel gateway that hands control over to the Warehouse lane. The Warehouse executes **“Prepare for picking up goods”** and finally reaches the end event **“Shipment prepared.”** This sequence ensures that shipment method clarification, optional special handling, optional insurance, labeling, packaging choice, and final preparation are coordinated before the goods are ready for dispatch."}
