,-0.00810422,0.042473827,0.06436444,0.009210484,-0.024974743,0.05159212,-3.0413088e-05,-0.008347264,0.008162886,-0.048105713,-0.0302714,0.014750184,-0.011347584,-0.006746533,-0.02909809,0.049379595,0.028595243,0.008707637,-0.06661049,-0.009210484,0.0023110018,-0.016267106,-0.023499725,0.01215214,-0.020097125,0.019745132,-0.041468132,0.061414402,0.02195766,0.01801869,-0.005522938,0.020063603,-0.033405814,-0.0142138135,0.024253996,0.013250023,-0.021354243,-0.018722676,0.008493927,-8.361144e-05,0.009855805,0.018454492,-0.02547759,-0.00020336502,0.0024702367,-0.0112972995,-0.0013597825,0.01161577,0.0077773696,-0.029248944,0.01332545,0.019275809,-0.014322764,0.03965788,-0.038551617,0.007504994,0.0029186087,-0.043881796,-0.008808207,-0.009830662,-0.04233973,-0.033288483,-0.012562798,0.008866872,-0.02024798,-0.048910268,0.03593681,0.02877962]	The process models the fulfil‑ment of a production order within an organization. It begins with a **Start Event** where the required parts, quantities and delivery date are determined ( *Determine parts, amounts, and delivery date* ). This information is transferred to the production planning system ( *Transfer data to PPS* ) and then an exclusive gateway checks whether all parts are already available. If parts are missing, the **Procure parts** task is executed; once the parts are obtained the flow reconverges with the “all parts available” branch. After the parts‑availability check a **Ready to start production** intermediate event signals that the order can proceed. The **Produce order** task, performed by a Worker, creates the product. Upon completion, the order is handed to the Quality Inspector who **Reviews quality**. If the inspection is successful, the process ends at the **Process of production is finished** end‑event. If the quality is unsatisfactory, the flow returns to the **Produce order** task for re‑work. The diagram is organized into three lanes: *Master Individual Production* (planning and parts handling), *Worker* (actual manufacturing), and *Quality Inspector* (inspection), clearly separating responsibilities while the gateways and loops capture the decision points for part availability and quality control.	{"id": "PartProduction_V3", "source": "/app/bpmn_examples/CoherenceCheckingDataset/Part Production/PartProduction_V3.bpmn", "bpmn_model_xml": "<?xml version=\\"1.0\\" encoding=\\"UTF-8\\"?>\\n<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn=\\"http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL\\" xmlns:bpmndi=\\"http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI\\" xmlns:xsi=\\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\\" xmlns:dc=\\"http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC\\" xmlns:di=\\"http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI\\" id=\\"Definitions_1\\" targetNamespace=\\"http://bpmn.io/schema/bpmn\\" exporter=\\"Camunda Modeler\\" exporterVersion=\\"1.2.0\\">\\n  <bpmn:collaboration id=\\"Collaboration_0kn3djs\\">\\n    <bpmn:participant id=\\"Participant_1845noj\\" name=\\"Organization\\" processRef=\\"Process_01fm2bb\\" />\\n  </bpmn:collaboration>\\n  <bpmn:process id=\\"Process_01fm2bb\\">\\n    <bpmn:laneSet id=\\"LaneSet_0oomcfn\\">\\n      <bpmn:lane id=\\"Lane_02df9n1\\" name=\\"Production\\">\\n        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Event_0uc63cr</bpmn:flowNodeRef>\\n        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Activity_1x8qoda</bpmn:flowNodeRef>\\n        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gateway_1xtagqf</bpmn:flowNodeRef>\\n        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Activity_08rged1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>\\n        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gateway_10gbw30</bpmn:flowNodeRef>\\n        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Event_0bf4ukb</bpmn:flowNodeRef>\\n        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Activity_075oyht</bpmn:flowNodeRef>\\n        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Activity_0nyzcmi</bpmn:flowNodeRef>\\n        <bpmn:childLaneSet id=\\"LaneSet_1etcvxq\\">\\n          <bpmn:lane id=\\"Lane_0ip96bp\\" name=\\"Master Individual Production\\">\\n            <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Event_0uc63cr</bpmn:flowNodeRef>\\n            <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Activity_1x8qoda</bpmn:flowNodeRef>\\n            <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gateway_1xtagqf</bpmn:flowNodeRef>\\n            <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Activity_08rged1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>\\n            <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gateway_10gbw30</bpmn:flowNodeRef>\\n            <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Event_0bf4ukb</bpmn:flowNodeRef>\\n            <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Activity_0nyzcmi</bpmn:flowNodeRef>\\n          </bpmn:lane>\\n          <bpmn:lane id=\\"Lane_1egzsx8\\" name=\\"Worker\\">\\n            <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Activity_075oyht</bpmn:flowNodeRef>\\n          </bpmn:lane>\\n        </bpmn:childLaneSet>\\n      </bpmn:lane>\\n      <bpmn:lane id=\\"Lane_1nf1nvp\\" name=\\"Quality Inspector\\">\\n        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Activity_1i4ectf</bpmn:flowNodeRef>\\n        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Event_0vgf1qh</bpmn:flowNodeRef>\\n      </bpmn:lane>\\n    </bpmn:laneSet>\\n    <bpmn:startEvent id=\\"Event_0uc63cr\\">\\n      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_0ibtc2w</bpmn:outgoing>\\n    </bpmn:startEvent>\\n    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id=\\"Flow_0ibtc2w\\" sourceRef=\\"Event_0uc63cr\\" targetRef=\\"Activity_0nyzcmi\\" />\\n    <bpmn:task id=\\"Activity_1x8qoda\\" name=\\"Transfer data to PPS\\">\\n      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_13qpkbc</bpmn:incoming>\\n      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_11xscko</bpmn:outgoing>\\n    </bpmn:task>\\n    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id=\\"Flow_13qpkbc\\" sourceRef=\\"Activity_0nyzcmi\\" targetRef=\\"Activity_1x8qoda\\" />\\n    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id=\\"Gateway_1xtagqf\\" default=\\"Flow_1c6t8xf\\">\\n      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_11xscko</bpmn:incoming>\\n      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_11m1flk</bpmn:outgoing>\\n      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_1c6t8xf</bpmn:outgoing>\\n    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>\\n    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id=\\"Flow_11xscko\\" sourceRef=\\"Activity_1x8qoda\\" targetRef=\\"Gateway_1xtagqf\\" />\\n    <bpmn:task id=\\"Activity_08rged1\\" name=\\"Procure parts\\">\\n      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_11m1flk</bpmn:incoming>\\n      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_0fb3n8b</bpmn:outgoing>\\n    </bpmn:task>\\n    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id=\\"Flow_11m1flk\\" name=\\"Parts are missing\\" sourceRef=\\"Gateway_1xtagqf\\" tar